WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:18.399
The witch has a big pot.

2
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.543
I wonder what it's for.

3
00:00:22.544 --> 00:00:35.264
Polly: I'll save you, Jack!

4
00:00:35.265 --> 00:00:39.656
Witch: Leave my supper

5
00:00:39.657 --> 00:00:45.262
alone! Jack: Supper? You're going to eat

6
00:00:45.263 --> 00:00:50.481
me? Witch: Yes. When you're nice and

7
00:00:50.482 --> 00:00:53.925
fat. Have more candy.

8
00:00:53.926 --> 00:00:58.861
Polly: You can't eat Jack!

9
00:00:58.862 --> 00:01:01.308
Witch: Yes, I can.

10
00:01:01.309 --> 00:01:10.692
Go start the fire in my oven.

11
00:01:10.693 --> 00:01:12.485
Polly: I need a plan.

12
00:01:12.486 --> 00:01:17.434
Witch: You in the cage! Stick out your ear.

13
00:01:17.435 --> 00:01:30.924
I'll check if you're ready to eat. Polly:

14
00:01:30.925 --> 00:01:41.220
Jack! Stick out this twig instead. Witch:

15
00:01:41.221 --> 00:01:45.851
You're not ready yet.

16
00:01:45.852 --> 00:01:48.254
Jack: Phew.

17
00:01:48.255 --> 00:02:00.824
Witch: But I'm hungry! Is my fire ready?

18
00:02:00.825 --> 00:02:15.983
Polly: Uh . . . Yes! Can you check it?

19
00:02:15.984 --> 00:02:26.679
Witch: You didn't start the fire!

20
00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:27.840
Polly: Got you!

21
00:02:27.841 --> 00:02:36.240
Witch: Ahh! Let me out of this

22
00:02:36.241 --> 00:02:51.091
oven! Jack: Polly, grab the

23
00:02:51.092 --> 00:03:06.684
key! Let's get out of here!

24
00:03:06.685 --> 00:03:08.574
Polly: We're back!

25
00:03:08.575 --> 00:03:14.274
Minnie: Polly! Jack! It's lunchtime.

26
00:03:14.275 --> 00:03:20.840
Omar: You worked hard today.

27
00:03:20.841 --> 00:03:24.789
The bird bath looks wonderful. Polly:

28
00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:26.369
We have to go.

29
00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:27.962
Jack: From now on . . .

30
00:03:27.963 --> 00:03:37.914
Polly: We'll be on time for meals! Bye, Omar.

